"P3253159460" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Two<br><br></color>Looks like you signed up just in time, {HeroName}. I'd like to say that Bunker raids were uncommon, but here in the <color orange>War Zone</color> anything's possible."
