// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CapturedSoldiers3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2999311997" "You rescued the Longbow P.O.W.s!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3598585271" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>You've done an excellent job protecting our interests and putting Longbow in their place. I'll have the Helm examine the intelligence from Lt. Tendaji. This could be quite a windfall. <br><br>Oh, and don't mind anything Captain Dietrich may have said. She's very vocal in her criticism of us. I'd say many here have a story about W. M. Dietrich."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1887895705" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>The Helm have confirmed the information Lt. Tendaji gave you. We've located a Rikti assault group. It seems they snuck past our defenses. This is an excellent chance to surprise them before they attack us. Your mission will be to take out the assault group as well its leader."
// AcceptString :
"P3036213071" "Take out Rikti assault group"
// SendOffString :
"P1205740972" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>We have a helicopter ready for you up top. It will take you to the area, then you will proceed to the site on your own. There will no doubt be other Rikti around, but your main objective is to take out the Rikti assault group and its leader. Good hunting!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2580287218" "Strike Rikti assault group"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2628680303" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>We don't know how much time you have before they attack, so I'd suggest you hurry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1875965364" "This looks like a good place for a pleasant stroll, not for a battle with alien invaders. Too bad."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P895060698" "Rikti Leader Sal'tar"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3378448158" "Surprise Conclusion: Urgent. Vanguard Activity: Likely"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2186802709" "Expression: Exasperation! <em>Conclusion: Even With: Advanced Intelligence: No Plan Survives Contact!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - BeatRiktiBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2894000508" "Defeat Rikti Leader Sal'tar"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1142476095" "You found what look like important documents on the Leader."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1878210547" "You took care of the Rikti assault group"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2374876255" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Four<br><br></color>So that intelligence from Tendaji was correct? Interesting. What's more interesting are those documents. Those look like an attack plan. We'll get this to the Helm, they should be able to decipher it. In the meantime, something's come up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2628454067" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Five<br><br></color><color orange>The Rikti have performed a mass-transport into a section of the</color><color red> Rogue Isles</color>. We don't know why, but we suspect that they're planting explosive devices. Your mission will be to destroy their bombs, and to evacuate any civilians still trapped in the area."
// AcceptString :
"P1336016489" "Stop Rikti Bombing"
// SendOffString :
"P3200127933" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Five<br><br></color>I know the Rogue Isles doesn't seem like a place worth saving, but it is, if only for the fact that the Rikti want to attack it. <br><br>The Vanguard's mission is to stop the Rikti any where, any time. So, If you thought you signed up for something else, I'm sorry. You should have joined Longbow instead.<br><br>You'll have 2 different things to do here. First off, there's the bombs. You need to destroy those. More importantly, there are a number of civilians trapped in the area. Rescuing them will help to make us look good. Or be the right thing to do, I suppose."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2961982178" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Five<br><br></color>Rember, the bombs are good; good to stop, I mean; but the hostages are better. Good luck!"

