// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P239520473" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>The Rikti are assaulting the base. We need your help now."
// AcceptString :
"P2735752000" "Defend the base!"
// SendOffString :
"P1701866920" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>There's no time to waste. You've got to get up there and defend the Vanguard base. Others are joining in the fight as well, but we really need your help on this."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P233432958" "Defend Vanguard Base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P65056850" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Vanguard<br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>The base is under attack and you stand here talking to me? Get up there."

